# Conformance probe pack for `until:127 chars:ascii7` (spec 0.22, ruling 9:
# the terminator 127 is a code the set gives no character). Public. No kinds.
# Most significant bit first.
#
#   label  7-bit characters up to the code 127
format     conformance-long-until-del
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:127  chars:ascii7
